WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.928 --> 00:00:18.656
"We should sneak back to the cave," Zella said again, picking at her flower noodles.

2
00:00:19.397 --> 00:00:21.778
She and Raff were eating lunch outside their house.

3
00:00:22.758 --> 00:00:23.659
Raff shook his head.

4
00:00:23.679 --> 00:00:25.980
"You heard what the mayor said.

5
00:00:26.660 --> 00:00:29.222
We're not supposed to go near it.

6
00:00:29.242 --> 00:00:30.322
Or the wormhole either."

7
00:00:30.342 --> 00:00:32.924
"What if there's another entrance to the cave?"

8
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:33.880
Zella said.

9
00:00:33.900 --> 00:00:36.441
"The grown-ups didn't even look for one!

10
00:00:37.121 --> 00:00:40.522
Somebody could have stolen that relic and whisked it away through the wormhole."

11
00:00:40.542 --> 00:00:45.063
"It's odd that none of the adults knew about the wormhole," Raff said.

12
00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:47.924
"I wonder how long it's been there."

13
00:00:47.944 --> 00:00:51.365
"Nobody goes to that part of the forest except for us.

14
00:00:52.045 --> 00:00:55.266
Anyway Zella shot a look at her brother.

15
00:00:55.286 --> 00:00:59.147
"Zann and his friends wouldn't give up on an adventure like this.

16
00:01:00.287 --> 00:01:02.068
Not even if the adults got in their way."

17
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.662
"Maybe." Raff sipped his airberry juice.

18
00:01:06.682 --> 00:01:10.444
"But they're heroes, and we're just regular kids."

19
00:01:11.965 --> 00:01:15.787
Zella shook her head, staring at the hat covering her brother's red hair.

20
00:01:16.868 --> 00:01:19.370
Raff wasn't exactly a "regular" kid.

21
00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:21.731
He was a Red, just like Zann.

22
00:01:22.652 --> 00:01:25.753
The problem was that her brother didn't like using magic.

23
00:01:26.774 --> 00:01:29.736
If he practiced more often, he could get a lot better at it.

24
00:01:30.580 --> 00:01:34.242
Just then a sudden movement near the edge of the forest caught her eye.

25
00:01:34.262 --> 00:01:36.964
"Wait. Is that Loro?

26
00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:38.945
Is he heading for the trail?"

27
00:01:39.685 --> 00:01:41.686
Before Raff could answer, she jumped up.

28
00:01:41.706 --> 00:01:44.067
"I think he's sneaking to the cave!

29
00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:46.349
Let's find him and see what he's doing."

30
00:01:47.409 --> 00:01:48.730
Raff looked surprised.

31
00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:51.511
"He didn't tell us he was going back.

32
00:01:52.672 --> 00:01:54.733
And he seemed kind of nervous in the cave."

33
00:01:54.753 --> 00:01:56.234
"Come on, Raff!"

34
00:01:57.094 --> 00:02:00.036
Zella pulled her brother up and they hurried toward the trail.

35
00:02:01.016 --> 00:02:04.959
But as they drew closer, she saw a man roping off the trail entrance.

36
00:02:04.979 --> 00:02:08.141
"Uh-oh," Raff said.

37
00:02:08.161 --> 00:02:12.985
"I bet the mayor wants to make sure that nobody takes this trail to the cave.

38
00:02:13.845 --> 00:02:15.086
She thinks it's not safe."

39
00:02:16.007 --> 00:02:17.468
"Darn," Zella thought.

40
00:02:17.488 --> 00:02:21.751
"We could try zapping to the cave, but we might not find Loro."

41
00:02:22.472 --> 00:02:23.332
She had an idea.

42
00:02:23.352 --> 00:02:24.513
"Wait here.

43
00:02:24.954 --> 00:02:25.814
I'll be right back."

44
00:02:26.675 --> 00:02:27.956
Zella ran back home.

45
00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:31.389
She found Muncher grazing in the neighbor's yard.

46
00:02:32.229 --> 00:02:33.709
She whistled for him to follow her.

47
00:02:34.730 --> 00:02:38.411
Soon she and Raff were approaching the man with the donkey following them.

48
00:02:39.251 --> 00:02:41.131
The man held up a hand to stop them.

49
00:02:41.151 --> 00:02:43.072
"Sorry, kids.

50
00:02:43.492 --> 00:02:46.573
Mayor Ruxton doesn't want anyone going past this point.

51
00:02:47.613 --> 00:02:49.874
Not until we figure out if that cave is safe.

52
00:02:50.614 --> 00:02:54.735
We also have to block off the wormhole so nobody stumbles into it accidentally."

53
00:02:56.236 --> 00:02:57.696
Zella smiled innocently.

54
00:02:58.624 --> 00:02:59.484
"Oh, don't worry.

55
00:02:59.724 --> 00:03:01.145
We aren't going near that cave.

56
00:03:02.045 --> 00:03:05.046
We're just taking our donkey out to eat the new patch of sprinkle thistles."

57
00:03:05.066 --> 00:03:07.286
"Sprinkle thistles?"

58
00:03:08.387 --> 00:03:09.647
The man looked surprised.

59
00:03:09.667 --> 00:03:12.848
"I thought your donkey already ate those."

60
00:03:14.048 --> 00:03:15.009
Zella thought fast.

61
00:03:15.029 --> 00:03:17.349
"Someone found another patch of them.

62
00:03:18.329 --> 00:03:20.610
The mayor asked us to take Muncher to it right away."

63
00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:23.071
She felt guilty for lying.

64
00:03:24.311 --> 00:03:27.012
She wondered if Zann and his friends ever lied to adults.

65
00:03:28.288 --> 00:03:29.529
But the story worked!

66
00:03:30.390 --> 00:03:31.590
The man let them pass.

67
00:03:32.551 --> 00:03:35.633
As soon as he was out of sight, the kids turned toward the cave.

68
00:03:36.534 --> 00:03:38.215
Raff suddenly seemed anxious.

69
00:03:39.016 --> 00:03:41.257
"This isn't a good idea, Zella.

70
00:03:42.018 --> 00:03:45.040
The staff is gone, so there's nothing for us to do.

71
00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.862
And Loro was probably just exploring the forest or something.

72
00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:51.264
We'll never find him."

73
00:03:52.545 --> 00:03:54.646
"Wrong!" Zella said with a grin.

74
00:03:54.666 --> 00:03:56.528
"Loro's right up there."

75
00:03:57.760 --> 00:04:00.401
When they caught up to him, Loro looked startled.

76
00:04:00.421 --> 00:04:03.663
"Oh! You two are here too."

77
00:04:03.683 --> 00:04:06.464
"You inspired us," Zella said.

78
00:04:06.484 --> 00:04:10.586
"We saw you slip into the forest and wondered if you were going to try to sneak into

79
00:04:10.626 --> 00:04:11.066
the cave."

80
00:04:11.086 --> 00:04:14.348
"I'm glad you came," Loro said.

81
00:04:14.368 --> 00:04:17.670
"It's safer if we all go inside the cave.

82
00:04:18.650 --> 00:04:20.971
And I was just going to look around a little bit more.

83
00:04:21.952 --> 00:04:26.956
I mean, it's not likely, but what if a wild animal carried that relic off to another part

84
00:04:26.996 --> 00:04:27.637
of the cave?

85
00:04:28.457 --> 00:04:32.041
Everyone could be worried about its disappearance for no reason."

86
00:04:32.061 --> 00:04:35.604
"Hmm." Zella was doubtful.

87
00:04:35.624 --> 00:04:42.330
"I guess that's possible, but "Come on, let's go," Loro said.

88
00:04:43.351 --> 00:04:44.652
They headed into the cave.

89
00:04:45.593 --> 00:04:49.096
Once again Muncher turned back when the tunnel got too narrow.

90
00:04:50.156 --> 00:04:53.617
But the three kids were able to squeeze through several new passages.

91
00:04:54.597 --> 00:04:56.058
They found a few more rooms.

92
00:04:56.258 --> 00:04:58.378
But there was no sign of the staff anywhere.

93
00:04:58.398 --> 00:05:00.639
"Now what?"

94
00:05:01.099 --> 00:05:04.700
Raff asked as they held up their lights to look around a small chamber.

95
00:05:04.720 --> 00:05:07.321
"We haven't explored the whole cave yet."

96
00:05:08.121 --> 00:05:10.562
Zella pointed to an opening in the far wall.

97
00:05:10.582 --> 00:05:12.262
"Let's go that way."

98
00:05:12.982 --> 00:05:14.603
They stepped into a new tunnel.

99
00:05:15.803 --> 00:05:18.644
It was wide enough for the three of them to walk side by side.

100
00:05:19.488 --> 00:05:23.570
The ceiling was so high that Zella couldn't see it in the dim light.

101
00:05:23.590 --> 00:05:26.771
"Brighter," she said, snapping her fingers.

102
00:05:27.692 --> 00:05:29.973
Her light grew brighter but not by much.

103
00:05:31.393 --> 00:05:32.874
Raff noticed what she was doing.

104
00:05:32.894 --> 00:05:35.755
"It's hard to do magic down here.

105
00:05:36.635 --> 00:05:38.376
I wonder if that's normal in caves.

106
00:05:39.897 --> 00:05:41.918
Or maybe there's some sort of—ahh!"

107
00:05:42.518 --> 00:05:44.499
He pitched forward, arms flailing.

108
00:05:45.139 --> 00:05:46.660
"Raff!" Zella cried.

109
00:05:47.412 --> 00:05:49.434
She grabbed his shirt and hauled him back.

110
00:05:50.275 --> 00:05:53.998
At the same time, one of her feet slid off the edge of a drop-off.

111
00:05:55.219 --> 00:05:58.281
She jumped back just in time to keep from falling.

112
00:05:59.162 --> 00:06:02.645
Hiss! Loro stood frozen.

113
00:06:02.665 --> 00:06:04.847
"What's that noise?"

114
00:06:06.248 --> 00:06:07.409
Zella leaned forward.

115
00:06:08.490 --> 00:06:12.153
She and her brother had almost fallen into another deep hole.

116
00:06:12.933 --> 00:06:15.836
But unlike the previous one, this one wasn't empty.

117
00:06:16.488 --> 00:06:21.333
A mass of slender shapes writhed at the bottom, making a loud hissing sound!

118
00:06:22.314 --> 00:06:24.376
Zella recognized the creatures immediately.

119
00:06:25.056 --> 00:06:28.520
They were among the most dangerous animals in Magica.

120
00:06:28.540 --> 00:06:32.023
"It's a whole nest of cave vipers!"

121
00:06:32.363 --> 00:06:33.965
she said, her voice shaking.

122
00:06:33.985 --> 00:06:36.908
"And we almost fell down there with them!"
